@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5078

### feature/membership-card
### 会员登录（USERS + BCrypt）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginType": "member",
  "loginName": "demo_member",
  "password": "Demo@123456"
}

### 会员注册（先 USERS 后 MEMBER）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginName": "new_member",
  "password": "Demo@123456",
  "name": "新会员",
  "phoneNumber": "13900000002",
  "gender": "M"
}

### 查询会员
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/members/1
Accept: application/json

### 更新会员档案
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/members/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "演示会员",
  "phoneNumber": "13800000001",
  "gender": "M"
}

### feature/membership-card
### 张三 · 正常时效卡（memberId=1001，期望 isValid=true）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards?memberId=1001
Accept: application/json

###

### 李四 · 次卡次数为 0（memberId=1002，期望 isValid=false）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards?memberId=1002
Accept: application/json

###

### 王五 · 时效卡过期（memberId=1003，期望 isValid=false）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards?memberId=1003
Accept: application/json

###

### 旧会员无卡（memberId=1，期望空数组 []）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards?memberId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 单张卡详情 · 张三（cardId=1001）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards/1001
Accept: application/json

###

### 单张卡详情 · 李四（cardId=1002，remainingCount=0）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards/1002
Accept: application/json

###

### 不存在的卡（期望 404）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards/99999
Accept: application/json

###

### 可购会员卡商品列表
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/card-products
Accept: application/json

###

### 模拟支付购卡（memberId + priceId）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/membership-cards/purchase-mock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1001,
  "priceId": 3
}

###

### 员工管理：商品列表（含下架）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/card-products/manage
Accept: application/json

###

### 员工管理：新增商品
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/card-products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productType": "MEMBERSHIP_TIME_90",
  "standardPrice": 599.00
}

###

### 员工管理：下架商品（PATCH isActive=false）
PATCH {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/card-products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}